; CanonSim Workbench — the semantic-token theme (wb-2, frontend §10–§16;
; wb-10 the first visual pass; wb-12 the token-audit re-pin — the owner's
; 2026-09-26 «нынешний ui - ужасен» + this session's «тема и UI все так же
; убоги» calls, per docs/VISUAL_SYSTEM_UI.md the law owner).
;
; The single source of the Workbench visual language (frontend §10: the
; ladder `primitives -> semantic tokens -> component tokens -> component
; states -> composition` — values never scattered into code). Three layers
; live here:
;   1. `Workbench/*` — the semantic TOKEN namespace: colours, type sizes,
;      spacings and the chrome styleboxes. The shell script reads them by
;      name (theme.get_color / get_constant / get_stylebox) — composition
;      code carries token NAMES only, never raw values.
;   2. The component tokens — the styled Control types (Button, the
;      NavButton variation, LineEdit, Label, PanelContainer) with their
;      state sets (default/hover/pressed/hover_pressed/focus/disabled/
;      readonly — §10's component-state law).
;   3. Layered dark surfaces (§12: never pure black) with WCAG-baseline
;      contrast — the measured pairs noted below.
;
; The wb-12 audit (VISUAL_SYSTEM_UI §2's taxonomy + §3's color law):
;   - ONE accent (the soft blue #89b4fa family) — interactive affordances
;     and the live/GENERATING state; the old warm-orange accent family and
;     its brown-tinted pressed/selected surfaces RETIRED (accent_deep has
;     no consumer left — the audit's retire).
;   - The neutral ramp re-pinned over a value reference: the Catppuccin
;     Mocha ramp (catppuccin.com — MIT-licensed palette; VALUES adapted
;     onto the Workbench role tokens, no assets, no code — §6's
;     transplantation protocol: the mechanism taken is the tuned layered
;     luminance separation, not a look).
;   - Role names audited: background_base (CANVAS) / surface_l* (SURFACE)
;     / text_* (CONTENT) / hairline+border_field (BORDER) / status_*
;     (STATE) / authority_* (AUTHORITY) — all role-named, none renamed.
;   - NEW tokens: the NavButton type variation (the rail's quiet
;     navigation set) + styles/chip_busy (the chat GENERATING carrier).
;
; Contrast pairs (WCAG 2.2 baseline, §12 — measured over the sRGB math):
;   text_primary   #cdd6f4 on surface_l2 #1e1e2e  ~11.3:1
;   text_secondary #a6adc8 on surface_l2           ~7.4:1
;   text_muted     #8b90a8 on surface_l1 #181825   ~5.6:1
;   accent         #89b4fa on surface_l2           ~7.8:1
;   on_accent      #11111b on accent    #89b4fa   ~8.7:1
;   border_field   #6c6f85 vs input bg #11111b     ~3.7:1 (non-text, >=3:1)
; Colour is never the sole state channel (§12): states pair with text or
; position. This file is the wb-2 deliverable "the semantic-token theme
; file" (TASKS wb-2, CONTRACTS §5); identity = its sha256 (carried by the
; shell proof metadata).
;
; Theme id: canon_workbench_theme@0.3 (dark — the only admitted theme).

[gd_resource type="Theme" load_steps=22 format=3]

